    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Paula Treacy Estates very proudly present to the market a fantastic once off opportunity to acquire a Most Charming Seaside Cottage with Extensive Outbuildings & Original Stone Cottage on c. 0.319 Acres approx. within very easy walking access to Curracloe Beach & The Raven Woods.  Currently in a derelict state this property can most likely avail of  various grants to include the vacant home grant, SEAI etc. \r\nVery rarely do properties come to the market in this location.  Ideally located adjacent to Curracloe Beach, The Raven woods and walks,  the property enjoys a highly sought-after setting within easy reach of local shops, restaurants, schools, churches and everyday amenities. Blackwater, Castlebridge and Wexford Town are all just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nSet on an elevated site with excellent road frontage and easy access, this charming property presents a rare opportunity to restore and create a wonderful coastal home or investment. The accommodation includes a cottage in need of renovation together with an original classic cottage, offering excellent scope for restoration or redevelopment (subject to the necessary planning permissions). A generous range of outbuildings provides exceptional versatility, making them suitable for storage, workshops, hobby space or a variety of other uses.\r\n\r\nThis superbly positioned property offers outstanding potential in one of County Wexford's most desirable coastal locations.\r\nThis Property is being Sold as Seen ( ie not subject to planning permission ) Drawings included are for illustrative purposes showing the huge development potential.\r\n\r\nDirections\r\nY21NH21 (Property beside) \r\nFrom Wexford direction, proceed through the village of Curracloe and turn right just before Hammel’s Centra, continue straight for 950m, then take a right turn towards Ravenswood Nature reserve, and continue for another 650m. The property will be on the right-hand side, sign on same.\r\n\r\nBER: G \r\nBER No. 112224969 \r\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 526.95 kWh/m²/yr\r\n\r\nContact Paula Treacy Estates 0539242140."
      },
      {
